=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Sobane} to begin this quest.
** You will need to zone after finishing {q:Signed in Blood|Signed in Blood|Signed in Blood}.
* You will need a {@i:Attohwa Ginseng|1683} {i:Attohwa Ginseng|Attohwa Ginseng|1683} for the next part of the quest.
** {@i:Attohwa Ginseng|1683} {i:Attohwa Ginseng|Attohwa Ginseng|1683} drops off {m:Gallinippers|Gallinipper}, {m:Ogreflys|Ogrefly}, and {m:Monarch Ogreflys|Monarch Ogrefly} in {z:Attohwa Chasm}.
* Enter {z:Carpenters' Landing} by taking the entrance from {z:Jugner Forest} (J-8).
** The {z:Carpenters' Landing} Survival Guide will put you right next to {n:Anguenet}.
* Speak to {n:Anguenet} (J-10) and trade him the {@i:Attohwa Ginseng|1683} {i:Attohwa Ginseng|Attohwa Ginseng|1683}. In return, he will give you a {@k} {k:Tonberry blackboard}.
* Purchase a ticket and board a barge headed for Central Landing via Emfea Way.
** This barge leaves at 00:50 every game day, from the docks next to {n:Anguenet}.
* On the ship, you will find {n:Riche}. Speak to him and ask him all five questions. After you ask him all the questions, he will take the {@k} {k:Tonberry blackboard} from you.
* Head to {z:Fei'Yin} and kill the {m:Shadows|Shadow} there until they drop {i:Treasury Gold|Treasury Gold|1682}.
** You only need one per party.
* Go to {z:Davoi} and trade the {@i:Treasury Gold|1682} {i:Treasury Gold|Treasury Gold|1682} to the **???** (J-11) to spawn the {p:NM} {m:Hematic Cyst}.
* After the {m:Hematic Cyst} is defeated, check the **???** again for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Sobane} for your reward.

